infestation it's developed by team ninja  the studio behind the brutally difficult  Ninja Gaiden series horizon zero dawn is  an upcoming open-world action RPG that  puts you in control of a hunter named  alloy as she journeys across a  post-apocalyptic world dominated by  mechanical creatures near automata is  the  Seagal to a cult favorite action RPG  released in 2010 it takes place sometime  after the events of the first game and  puts you in the role of a powerful  Android soldier tasked with driving off  an invasion of machine-like beings  Kingdom Hearts HD 1.5 plus 2.5 remix is  a ps4 re-release of the ps3  high-definition remaster ease of several  Kingdom Hearts games M will be the show  17 once again provides fans with a  realistic baseball experience while  adding a variety of new features such as  the ability to import career saves from  last year and an in-depth RPG mode that  allows you to influence the season in  myriad ways both on the field and off  danganronpa one to reload is a  collection of the first two games in the  cult favourite dangan ronpa adventure  game series the long-running Shin Megami  Tensei persona series is back with its  fifth entry it follows The Adventures of  a group of high school students who  secretly moonlight as supernatural cat  burglars the silver case is an HD  remaster of developer suda51 s first  game with studio grasshopper  manufacturer set in a city called the 24  wards it tells the story of a bizarre  series of murders and the detectives  investigating the case Dragon Quest  Heroes 2 is the latest in the mashup  series between dynasty Warriors and  Dragon Quest  it expands upon its predecessor by  providing online multiplayer with up to  four people as well as the ability to  transform into and battle as monsters  birthdays the beginning is the newest  game by legendary Japanese developer  Yasuhiro wada the creator of the Harvest  Moon series it's a colorful God game  that focuses on simple  easy-to-understand mechanics Ace Combat  7 is the first true addition to the  long-running flight simulator series in  nearly a decade it fully supports  PlayStation VR which means your dream of  being an ace fighter pilot is this much  closer to becoming a reality  boundless is a sandbox MMORPG where you  and others explore a procedurally  generated world its major highlight is  its portal mechanic which lets you place  doors that can take you to other worlds  Hatsune Miku Project Diva future tone is  a ps4 port of the rhythm game Hatsune  Miku Project Diva arcade crash bandicoot  and sane trilogy is a collection of  high-definition remasters of the  first three crash bandicoot games dangan  ronpa  v3 killing harmony continues the bloody  saga of previous games pitting another  group of students against one another in  a battle royale asked conflict of  violence and logic deaths gambit is an  atmospheric of Dark Souls like dungeon  crawler that's displayed from a 2d  side-scroller perspective  Final Fantasy 12 the zodiac age is the  high-definition remaster of the  critically acclaimed 12th entry in the  Final Fantasy series rather than build  upon the version that launched in the  u.s. in 2006 the game is a remaster of  the expanded international zodiac job  system Edition which was only released  in Japan Gran Turismo sport is the  latest entry the long-running racing  simulator series it focuses on providing  players with real-life awards for  competing in and winning FIA sponsored  racing competitions hell-blade sin us  sacrifice is the latest action game by  Ninja Theory the studio behind Heavenly  Sword enslaved Odyssey of the West and  DMC Devil May Cry the game's story is  based around Celtic mythology and tells  the story of sin Ewan a warrior  embarking on a journey through a hellish  underworld house marks latest offering  next machina death machine is a  twin-stick shooter that channel's the  energy of genre classics like Robotron  2084 and Smash TV nidhogg to brings back  its predecessors signature  back-and-forth competitive swordplay  while adding in a wealth of new  abilities and weapons as well as an  expressive new visual style ninokuni 2  revenant kingdom is the long-awaited  sequel to 2010's ninokuni wrath of the  white witch rather than focus on the  continued adventures of the protagonist  from the first game it introduces a  completely new cast of characters who  must fight against an emerging threat in  the kingdom of dingdong del pyre is the  latest game by supergiant games the  studio behind the critically acclaimed  Bastion and transistor  it's an action RPG that tasks you with  leading a band of X Isles to freedom  from a dangerous and mystical land  Parappa the rapper remastered is an HD  re-release of the fan-favorite 1997 ps1  rhythm game the long-awaited third entry  in the cult classic Shenmue series  continues ro hazuki's desperate search  for his father's killer laundy uncharted  the law  legacy is a standalone chapter in the  Uncharted series where you play as fan  favorite character  Chloe Fraser as she embarks on an  adventure in search of a mystical  treasure known as the Tusk of Ganesha  what remains of Edith Finch is an  adventure game that tells the story of  Edith the last surviving member of the  Finch family who's on a personal journey  to discover the truth behind her  mysterious heritage yakaza kiwami is a  remake of the first entry of the Yakuza  series it improves the resolution  textures and loading times of the  original as well as clear up some of  that game's more confusing plot lines  and inconsistencies and that's all the  ps4 console exclusives confirmed for  2017 but there's still time for more to  be confirmed this year so let us know in  the comments below what other games you  think will come out for more on all  things ps4 stick to GameSpot  [Music]

